-- ACTOR ----------------- errors/spawn_not_actor_1.march

`helper` is a function, not an actor, so `spawn` cannot start it. [spawn_not_actor]
`spawn` takes the name of an `actor` declaration, like `spawn(Counter)`.

16 |     let p = spawn(helper)
                       ^^^^^^

    run `march --explain spawn_not_actor`


